cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
title: "Neurofluid–MREG: BIDS-first vascular segmentation and spectral analysis pipeline"
abstract: |
  Open-source, BIDS-first pipeline linking ultra-fast MREG BOLD signals
  to vascular structures (arteries, veins, PVS) via native-space segmentation,
  distance/radii mapping, and band-limited spectral analysis.
authors:
  - family-names: Tashraf Hussain
