keywords:
  - MRI
  - MREG
  - BOLD
  - Vascular segmentation
  - Perivascular spaces
  - Frangi
  - DIPY
  - NiBabel
  - BIDS
acknowledgments: >
  I would like to thank Dr. Hendrik Mattern (Department of Biomedical Magnetic Resonance,
  Institute of Physics, Otto-von-Guericke University Magdeburg) for his valuable guidance,
  insightful discussions, and for providing reference code snippets and methodological advice
  that helped shape this work.
